  "detail_text": "BSA is procuring a Milli-Kelvin Scanning Probe Microscope. The mK-SPM instrument, shall operate tuning-fork-based atomic force microscopy (TFAFM) and be designed to support optimum operation of scanning Microwave Impedance Microscopy (sMIM) and Scanning Resonator Microscopy (SRM) at a base temperature <= 20 mK inside a fully shielded low noise environment within high vacuum (HV).",
